# Cac file appcast duoc KY bang Ed25519 va chu ky nam trong file .signature di kem.
# Chu ky tinh tren TUNG BYTE cua file. Neu git tu doi LF <-> CRLF khi commit hay
# khi checkout thi byte doi theo -> chu ky khong con khop -> ung dung KHONG BAO GIO
# thay ban cap nhat, va khong co thong bao loi nao chi ra nguyen nhan.
#
# May phat hanh dat core.autocrlf=true, nen KHONG co dong nay la som muon cung hong.
#
# Dung mau '*' de khi them kien truc moi thi khong phai nho sua file nay - quen mot
# dong la hong am tham o dung nen tang do.
appcast*.xml            -text
appcast*.xml.signature  -text
